              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ufu 6:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mahali pa Aveni palipoinuka, yaani, dhambi ya Israeli, pataharibika; mwiba na mbigili itamea juu ya madhabahu zake; nao wataiambia milima, Tusitirini; na vilima, Tuangukieni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JDG.19.1+JDG.19.2+JDG.19.3+JDG.19.4+JDG.19.5+JDG.19.6+JDG.19.7+JDG.19.8+JDG.19.9+JDG.19.10+JDG.19.11+JDG.19.12+JDG.19.13+JDG.19.14+JDG.19.15+JDG.19.16+JDG.19.17+JDG.19.18+JDG.19.19+JDG.19.20+JDG.19.21+JDG.19.22+JDG.19.23+JDG.19.24+JDG.19.25+JDG.19.26+JDG.19.27+JDG.19.28+JDG.19.29+JDG.19.30"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amu 19:1-30",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ee Israeli, umefanya dhambi tangu siku za Gibea; huko ndiko walikosimama; ili vita vilivyokuwa juu ya wana wa uovu visiwapate katika Gibea. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.28.63"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kum 28:63",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.14.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Fal 14:16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "AMO.8.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Amo 8:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati nitakapopenda nitawaadhibu; na hao mataifa watakusanyika juu yao, watakapofungwa kwa sababu ya makosa yao mawili. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Efraimu ni ndama aliyefundishwa, apendaye kupura; lakini nimepitisha kongwa juu ya shingo yake nzuri; nitampandisha mwenye kupanda juu ya Efraimu; Yuda atalima, na Yakobo atavunja madongoa yake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
